Test Template: Unicode Compact Syntax
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The compact unicode syntax is a simple 1:1-replacement for multi-character
ASCII tokens with single Unicode-Characters. It's use is purely optional
and serves as "syntactic sugar".

